OL,3,GNEWSALorry crash closes A1 southbound
OL,4,Anear Newark
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have been called to the A1 in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire after a lorry crashed
OL,8,Finto the central reservation.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the southbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway was closed between the
OL,12,FA6075 at Tuxford and the A46 near
OL,13,FNewark.
OL,15,FThey added drivers are to expect delays
OL,16,Fof at least 20 minutes and about two
OL,17,Fmiles of congestion on the approach to
OL,18,Fthe closure.
OL,20,FMotorists have been advised to allow
OL,21,Fextra time for their journeys.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
